{"schemaVersion":2,"bookId":"bishop-deep-learning-2024","title":"附录 C 拉格朗日乘子","sourcePdfPages":[628,631],"toc":[{"number":"附录 C","title":"拉格朗日乘子","block":"p01-b001","level":1}],"images":["books/bishop-deep-learning-2024/assets/appendix-c/fig-c-1.png","books/bishop-deep-learning-2024/assets/appendix-c/fig-c-2.png","books/bishop-deep-learning-2024/assets/appendix-c/fig-c-3.png"],"blocks":[{"id":"p01-b001","page":1,"pdfPage":628,"kind":"heading","level":1,"text":"附录 C 拉格朗日乘子"},{"id":"p01-b002","page":1,"pdfPage":628,"kind":"intro","text":"本附录导读 本附录用几何图像解释拉格朗日乘子，随后给出等式约束、不等式约束和多个约束下的驻点条件。","segments":["本附录导读 本附录用几何图像解释拉格朗日乘子，随后给出等式约束、不等式约束和多个约束下的驻点条件。"]},{"id":"p01-b003","page":1,"pdfPage":628,"kind":"paragraph","text":"拉格朗日乘子（Lagrange multiplier）有时也称为待定乘子（undetermined multiplier），用于寻找多变量函数在一个或多个约束条件下的驻点。","segments":["拉格朗日乘子（Lagrange multiplier）有时也称为待定乘子（undetermined multiplier），用于寻找多变量函数在一个或多个约束条件下的驻点。"]},{"id":"p01-b004","page":1,"pdfPage":628,"kind":"paragraph","text":"考虑求函数 $f(x_1,x_2)$ 的最大值，同时要求 $x_1$ 和 $x_2$ 满足一个约束，写为","segments":["考虑求函数 ",{"tex":"f(x_1,x_2)","text":"f(x_1,x_2)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 的最大值，同时要求 ",{"tex":"x_1","text":"x_1","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></math>"}," 和 ",{"tex":"x_2","text":"x_2","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></math>"}," 满足一个约束，写为"]},{"id":"p01-b005","page":1,"pdfPage":628,"kind":"formula","tex":"g(x_1,x_2)=0.","text":"g(x_1,x_2)=0.","number":"(C.1)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow></math>"},{"id":"p01-b006","page":1,"pdfPage":628,"kind":"paragraph","text":"一种办法是求解约束方程 (C.1)，把 $x_2$ 表示为 $x_1$ 的函数 $x_2=h(x_1)$。再代入 $f(x_1,x_2)$，得到只依赖于 $x_1$ 的函数 $f(x_1,h(x_1))$。随后按通常的方法求导，找到关于 $x_1$ 的最大值所对应的驻点 $x_1^\\star$；相应的 $x_2$ 为 $x_2^\\star=h(x_1^\\star)$。","segments":["一种办法是求解约束方程 (C.1)，把 ",{"tex":"x_2","text":"x_2","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></math>"}," 表示为 ",{"tex":"x_1","text":"x_1","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></math>"}," 的函数 ",{"tex":"x_2=h(x_1)","text":"x_2=h(x_1)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"},"。再代入 ",{"tex":"f(x_1,x_2)","text":"f(x_1,x_2)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"},"，得到只依赖于 ",{"tex":"x_1","text":"x_1","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></math>"}," 的函数 ",{"tex":"f(x_1,h(x_1))","text":"f(x_1,h(x_1))","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"},"。随后按通常的方法求导，找到关于 ",{"tex":"x_1","text":"x_1","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></math>"}," 的最大值所对应的驻点 ",{"tex":"x_1^\\star","text":"x_1^\\star","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup></mrow></math>"},"；相应的 ",{"tex":"x_2","text":"x_2","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></math>"}," 为 ",{"tex":"x_2^\\star=h(x_1^\\star)","text":"x_2^\\star=h(x_1^\\star)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"},"。"]},{"id":"p01-b007","page":1,"pdfPage":628,"kind":"paragraph","text":"这一办法的一个困难是，未必容易解析地求解约束方程，把 $x_2$ 显式地写成 $x_1$ 的函数。此外，它对 $x_1$ 和 $x_2$ 采取不同处理方式，破坏了两个变量之间自然的对称性。","segments":["这一办法的一个困难是，未必容易解析地求解约束方程，把 ",{"tex":"x_2","text":"x_2","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></math>"}," 显式地写成 ",{"tex":"x_1","text":"x_1","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></math>"}," 的函数。此外，它对 ",{"tex":"x_1","text":"x_1","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></math>"}," 和 ",{"tex":"x_2","text":"x_2","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></math>"}," 采取不同处理方式，破坏了两个变量之间自然的对称性。"]},{"id":"p01-b008","page":1,"pdfPage":628,"kind":"paragraph","text":"一种更优雅、通常也更简单的办法，是引入一个称为拉格朗日乘子的参数 $\\lambda$。下面从几何角度说明这种方法。考虑一个 $D$ 维变量 $\\mathbf x$，它的分量为 $x_1,\\ldots,x_D$。如图 C.1 所示，约束方程 $g(\\mathbf x)=0$ 在 $\\mathbf x$ 空间中表示一个 $D-1$ 维曲面。","segments":["一种更优雅、通常也更简单的办法，是引入一个称为拉格朗日乘子的参数 ",{"tex":"\\lambda","text":"\\lambda","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow></math>"},"。下面从几何角度说明这种方法。考虑一个 ",{"tex":"D","text":"D","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow></math>"}," 维变量 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf x","text":"\\mathbf x","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow></math>"},"，它的分量为 ",{"tex":"x_1,\\ldots,x_D","text":"x_1,\\ldots,x_D","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>D</mi></msub></mrow></math>"},"。如图 C.1 所示，约束方程 ",{"tex":"g(\\mathbf x)=0","text":"g(\\mathbf x)=0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"}," 在 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf x","text":"\\mathbf x","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow></math>"}," 空间中表示一个 ",{"tex":"D-1","text":"D-1","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></math>"}," 维曲面。"]},{"id":"p01-b009","page":1,"pdfPage":628,"kind":"paragraph","text":"首先，约束曲面上任意一点处，约束函数的梯度 $\\nabla g(\\mathbf x)$ 都与该曲面正交。为理解这一点，考虑曲面上的一个点 $\\mathbf x$，以及同样位于曲面上的邻近点 $\\mathbf x+\\boldsymbol\\epsilon$。在 $\\mathbf x$ 附近作 Taylor 展开，得到","segments":["首先，约束曲面上任意一点处，约束函数的梯度 ",{"tex":"\\nabla g(\\mathbf x)","text":"\\nabla g(\\mathbf x)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 都与该曲面正交。为理解这一点，考虑曲面上的一个点 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf x","text":"\\mathbf x","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow></math>"},"，以及同样位于曲面上的邻近点 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf x+\\boldsymbol\\epsilon","text":"\\mathbf x+\\boldsymbol\\epsilon","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">ϵ</mi></mrow></math>"},"。在 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf x","text":"\\mathbf x","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow></math>"}," 附近作 Taylor 展开，得到"]},{"id":"p01-b010","page":1,"pdfPage":628,"kind":"formula","tex":"g(\\mathbf x+\\boldsymbol\\epsilon)\\simeq g(\\mathbf x)+\\boldsymbol\\epsilon^{\\mathsf T}\\nabla g(\\mathbf x).","text":"g(\\mathbf x+\\boldsymbol\\epsilon)\\simeq g(\\mathbf x)+\\boldsymbol\\epsilon^{\\mathsf T}\\nabla g(\\mathbf x).","number":"(C.2)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">ϵ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≃</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">ϵ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"sans-serif\">T</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow></math>"},{"id":"p01-b011","page":1,"pdfPage":628,"kind":"paragraph","text":"因为 $\\mathbf x$ 和 $\\mathbf x+\\boldsymbol\\epsilon$ 都位于约束曲面上，$g(\\mathbf x)=g(\\mathbf x+\\boldsymbol\\epsilon)$，所以 $\\boldsymbol\\epsilon^{\\mathsf T}\\nabla g(\\mathbf x)\\simeq0$。在 $\\lVert\\boldsymbol\\epsilon\\rVert\\to0$ 的极限下，$\\boldsymbol\\epsilon^{\\mathsf T}\\nabla g(\\mathbf x)=0$。又因为 $\\boldsymbol\\epsilon$与约束曲面 $g(\\mathbf x)=0$ 平行，所以向量 $\\nabla g$ 是曲面的法向量。","segments":["因为 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf x","text":"\\mathbf x","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow></math>"}," 和 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf x+\\boldsymbol\\epsilon","text":"\\mathbf x+\\boldsymbol\\epsilon","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">ϵ</mi></mrow></math>"}," 都位于约束曲面上，",{"tex":"g(\\mathbf x)=g(\\mathbf x+\\boldsymbol\\epsilon)","text":"g(\\mathbf x)=g(\\mathbf x+\\boldsymbol\\epsilon)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">ϵ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"},"，所以 ",{"tex":"\\boldsymbol\\epsilon^{\\mathsf T}\\nabla g(\\mathbf x)\\simeq0","text":"\\boldsymbol\\epsilon^{\\mathsf T}\\nabla g(\\mathbf x)\\simeq0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">ϵ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"sans-serif\">T</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≃</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"},"。在 ",{"tex":"\\lVert\\boldsymbol\\epsilon\\rVert\\to0","text":"\\lVert\\boldsymbol\\epsilon\\rVert\\to0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">ϵ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"}," 的极限下，",{"tex":"\\boldsymbol\\epsilon^{\\mathsf T}\\nabla g(\\mathbf x)=0","text":"\\boldsymbol\\epsilon^{\\mathsf T}\\nabla g(\\mathbf x)=0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">ϵ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"sans-serif\">T</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"},"。又因为 ",{"tex":"\\boldsymbol\\epsilon","text":"\\boldsymbol\\epsilon","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">ϵ</mi></mrow></math>"},"与约束曲面 ",{"tex":"g(\\mathbf x)=0","text":"g(\\mathbf x)=0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"}," 平行，所以向量 ",{"tex":"\\nabla g","text":"\\nabla g","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></math>"}," 是曲面的法向量。"],"continuedPdfPages":[629]},{"id":"p02-b002","page":2,"pdfPage":629,"kind":"figure","src":"assets/appendix-c/fig-c-1.png","alt":"红色约束曲面 g(x)=0 上的点 x_A，梯度 ∇g 垂直曲面，∇f 与其反向平行","caption":"图 C.1：拉格朗日乘子法的几何图像：在约束 $g(\\mathbf x)=0$ 下使函数 $f(\\mathbf x)$ 最大。如果 $\\mathbf x$ 为 $D$ 维，约束 $g(\\mathbf x)=0$ 对应一个 $D-1$ 维子空间，图中的红色曲线表示它。这个问题可以通过优化拉格朗日函数 $L(\\mathbf x,\\lambda)=f(\\mathbf x)+\\lambda g(\\mathbf x)$ 来求解。","captionSegments":["图 C.1：拉格朗日乘子法的几何图像：在约束 ",{"tex":"g(\\mathbf x)=0","text":"g(\\mathbf x)=0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"}," 下使函数 ",{"tex":"f(\\mathbf x)","text":"f(\\mathbf x)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 最大。如果 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf x","text":"\\mathbf x","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow></math>"}," 为 ",{"tex":"D","text":"D","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow></math>"}," 维，约束 ",{"tex":"g(\\mathbf x)=0","text":"g(\\mathbf x)=0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"}," 对应一个 ",{"tex":"D-1","text":"D-1","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></math>"}," 维子空间，图中的红色曲线表示它。这个问题可以通过优化拉格朗日函数 ",{"tex":"L(\\mathbf x,\\lambda)=f(\\mathbf x)+\\lambda g(\\mathbf x)","text":"L(\\mathbf x,\\lambda)=f(\\mathbf x)+\\lambda g(\\mathbf x)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 来求解。"],"width":474,"height":471,"annotations":["图内符号：$\\nabla f(\\mathbf x)$ 为目标函数的梯度","$\\nabla g(\\mathbf x)$ 为约束函数的梯度","$\\mathbf x_A$ 为约束曲面上的点","红色边界表示 $g(\\mathbf x)=0$。"],"annotationSegments":[["图内符号：",{"tex":"\\nabla f(\\mathbf x)","text":"\\nabla f(\\mathbf x)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 为目标函数的梯度"],[{"tex":"\\nabla g(\\mathbf x)","text":"\\nabla g(\\mathbf x)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 为约束函数的梯度"],[{"tex":"\\mathbf x_A","text":"\\mathbf x_A","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow></math>"}," 为约束曲面上的点"],["红色边界表示 ",{"tex":"g(\\mathbf x)=0","text":"g(\\mathbf x)=0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"},"。"]]},{"id":"p02-b003","page":2,"pdfPage":629,"kind":"paragraph","text":"现在要在约束曲面上找到一个点 $\\mathbf x^\\star$，使 $f(\\mathbf x)$ 最大。如图 C.1 所示，在该点，向量 $\\nabla f(\\mathbf x)$ 也必须与约束曲面正交；否则，沿曲面移动一小段距离就可以增大 $f(\\mathbf x)$。因此，$\\nabla f$ 与 $\\nabla g$ 平行或反向平行，所以必存在一个参数 $\\lambda$，使得","segments":["现在要在约束曲面上找到一个点 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf x^\\star","text":"\\mathbf x^\\star","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></mrow></math>"},"，使 ",{"tex":"f(\\mathbf x)","text":"f(\\mathbf x)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 最大。如图 C.1 所示，在该点，向量 ",{"tex":"\\nabla f(\\mathbf x)","text":"\\nabla f(\\mathbf x)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 也必须与约束曲面正交；否则，沿曲面移动一小段距离就可以增大 ",{"tex":"f(\\mathbf x)","text":"f(\\mathbf x)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"},"。因此，",{"tex":"\\nabla f","text":"\\nabla f","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></math>"}," 与 ",{"tex":"\\nabla g","text":"\\nabla g","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></math>"}," 平行或反向平行，所以必存在一个参数 ",{"tex":"\\lambda","text":"\\lambda","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow></math>"},"，使得"]},{"id":"p02-b004","page":2,"pdfPage":629,"kind":"formula","tex":"\\nabla f+\\lambda\\nabla g=0,","text":"\\nabla f+\\lambda\\nabla g=0,","number":"(C.3)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></math>"},{"id":"p02-b005","page":2,"pdfPage":629,"kind":"paragraph","text":"其中 $\\lambda\\ne0$ 称为拉格朗日乘子。注意，$\\lambda$ 可以为正，也可以为负。","segments":["其中 ",{"tex":"\\lambda\\ne0","text":"\\lambda\\ne0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"}," 称为拉格朗日乘子。注意，",{"tex":"\\lambda","text":"\\lambda","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow></math>"}," 可以为正，也可以为负。"]},{"id":"p02-b006","page":2,"pdfPage":629,"kind":"paragraph","text":"现在定义拉格朗日函数（Lagrangian）","segments":["现在定义拉格朗日函数（Lagrangian）"]},{"id":"p02-b007","page":2,"pdfPage":629,"kind":"formula","tex":"L(\\mathbf x,\\lambda)\\equiv f(\\mathbf x)+\\lambda g(\\mathbf x).","text":"L(\\mathbf x,\\lambda)\\equiv f(\\mathbf x)+\\lambda g(\\mathbf x).","number":"(C.4)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≡</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow></math>"},{"id":"p02-b008","page":2,"pdfPage":629,"kind":"paragraph","text":"令 $\\nabla_{\\mathbf x}L=0$，就得到约束下的驻点条件 (C.3)。此外，条件 $\\partial L/\\partial\\lambda=0$ 给出约束方程 $g(\\mathbf x)=0$。","segments":["令 ",{"tex":"\\nabla_{\\mathbf x}L=0","text":"\\nabla_{\\mathbf x}L=0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></msub><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"},"，就得到约束下的驻点条件 (C.3)。此外，条件 ",{"tex":"\\partial L/\\partial\\lambda=0","text":"\\partial L/\\partial\\lambda=0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"}," 给出约束方程 ",{"tex":"g(\\mathbf x)=0","text":"g(\\mathbf x)=0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"},"。"]},{"id":"p02-b009","page":2,"pdfPage":629,"kind":"paragraph","text":"因此，若要在约束 $g(\\mathbf x)=0$ 下求 $f(\\mathbf x)$ 的最大值，可先按式 (C.4) 定义拉格朗日函数，再同时对 $\\mathbf x$ 和 $\\lambda$ 求 $L(\\mathbf x,\\lambda)$ 的驻点。对于 $D$ 维向量 $\\mathbf x$，这给出 $D+1$ 个方程，用来确定驻点 $\\mathbf x^\\star$ 和 $\\lambda$ 的值。如果只关心 $\\mathbf x^\\star$，就可以从驻点方程中消去 $\\lambda$，无需求出它的值；“待定乘子”一名也由此而来。","segments":["因此，若要在约束 ",{"tex":"g(\\mathbf x)=0","text":"g(\\mathbf x)=0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"}," 下求 ",{"tex":"f(\\mathbf x)","text":"f(\\mathbf x)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 的最大值，可先按式 (C.4) 定义拉格朗日函数，再同时对 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf x","text":"\\mathbf x","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow></math>"}," 和 ",{"tex":"\\lambda","text":"\\lambda","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow></math>"}," 求 ",{"tex":"L(\\mathbf x,\\lambda)","text":"L(\\mathbf x,\\lambda)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 的驻点。对于 ",{"tex":"D","text":"D","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow></math>"}," 维向量 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf x","text":"\\mathbf x","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow></math>"},"，这给出 ",{"tex":"D+1","text":"D+1","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></math>"}," 个方程，用来确定驻点 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf x^\\star","text":"\\mathbf x^\\star","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></mrow></math>"}," 和 ",{"tex":"\\lambda","text":"\\lambda","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow></math>"}," 的值。如果只关心 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf x^\\star","text":"\\mathbf x^\\star","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></mrow></math>"},"，就可以从驻点方程中消去 ",{"tex":"\\lambda","text":"\\lambda","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow></math>"},"，无需求出它的值；“待定乘子”一名也由此而来。"]},{"id":"p02-b010","page":2,"pdfPage":629,"kind":"paragraph","text":"举一个简单例子：在约束 $g(x_1,x_2)=x_1+x_2-1=0$ 下，求函数 $f(x_1,x_2)=1-x_1^2-x_2^2$ 的驻点，如图 C.2 所示。相应的拉格朗日函数是","segments":["举一个简单例子：在约束 ",{"tex":"g(x_1,x_2)=x_1+x_2-1=0","text":"g(x_1,x_2)=x_1+x_2-1=0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"}," 下，求函数 ",{"tex":"f(x_1,x_2)=1-x_1^2-x_2^2","text":"f(x_1,x_2)=1-x_1^2-x_2^2","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></math>"}," 的驻点，如图 C.2 所示。相应的拉格朗日函数是"]},{"id":"p02-b011","page":2,"pdfPage":629,"kind":"formula","tex":"L(\\mathbf x,\\lambda)=1-x_1^2-x_2^2+\\lambda(x_1+x_2-1).","text":"L(\\mathbf x,\\lambda)=1-x_1^2-x_2^2+\\lambda(x_1+x_2-1).","number":"(C.5)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow></math>"},{"id":"p02-b012","page":2,"pdfPage":629,"kind":"paragraph","text":"分别对 $x_1$、$x_2$ 和 $\\lambda$ 令该函数处于驻点，得到以下联立方程：","segments":["分别对 ",{"tex":"x_1","text":"x_1","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></math>"},"、",{"tex":"x_2","text":"x_2","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></math>"}," 和 ",{"tex":"\\lambda","text":"\\lambda","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow></math>"}," 令该函数处于驻点，得到以下联立方程："]},{"id":"p02-b013","page":2,"pdfPage":629,"kind":"formula","tex":"-2x_1+\\lambda=0,","text":"-2x_1+\\lambda=0,","number":"(C.6)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></math>"},{"id":"p02-b014","page":2,"pdfPage":629,"kind":"formula","tex":"-2x_2+\\lambda=0,","text":"-2x_2+\\lambda=0,","number":"(C.7)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></math>"},{"id":"p02-b015","page":2,"pdfPage":629,"kind":"formula","tex":"x_1+x_2-1=0.","text":"x_1+x_2-1=0.","number":"(C.8)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow></math>"},{"id":"p03-b001","page":3,"pdfPage":630,"kind":"figure","src":"assets/appendix-c/fig-c-2.png","alt":"函数 f 的同心圆等值线与约束直线 g(x1,x2)=0 在最优点相切","caption":"图 C.2：拉格朗日乘子的一个简单应用：在约束 $g(x_1,x_2)=0$ 下最大化 $f(x_1,x_2)=1-x_1^2-x_2^2$，其中 $g(x_1,x_2)=x_1+x_2-1$。圆表示函数 $f(x_1,x_2)$ 的等值线，对角线表示约束曲面 $g(x_1,x_2)=0$。","captionSegments":["图 C.2：拉格朗日乘子的一个简单应用：在约束 ",{"tex":"g(x_1,x_2)=0","text":"g(x_1,x_2)=0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"}," 下最大化 ",{"tex":"f(x_1,x_2)=1-x_1^2-x_2^2","text":"f(x_1,x_2)=1-x_1^2-x_2^2","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></math>"},"，其中 ",{"tex":"g(x_1,x_2)=x_1+x_2-1","text":"g(x_1,x_2)=x_1+x_2-1","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></math>"},"。圆表示函数 ",{"tex":"f(x_1,x_2)","text":"f(x_1,x_2)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 的等值线，对角线表示约束曲面 ",{"tex":"g(x_1,x_2)=0","text":"g(x_1,x_2)=0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"},"。"],"width":453,"height":462,"annotations":["图内符号：$x_1$、$x_2$ 为坐标轴","$(x_1^\\star,x_2^\\star)$ 为约束下的驻点","红色直线表示 $g(x_1,x_2)=0$。"],"annotationSegments":[["图内符号：",{"tex":"x_1","text":"x_1","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></math>"},"、",{"tex":"x_2","text":"x_2","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></math>"}," 为坐标轴"],[{"tex":"(x_1^\\star,x_2^\\star)","text":"(x_1^\\star,x_2^\\star)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 为约束下的驻点"],["红色直线表示 ",{"tex":"g(x_1,x_2)=0","text":"g(x_1,x_2)=0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"},"。"]]},{"id":"p03-b002","page":3,"pdfPage":630,"kind":"paragraph","text":"解这些方程，得到驻点 $(x_1^\\star,x_2^\\star)=(1/2,1/2)$，对应的拉格朗日乘子为 $\\lambda=1$。","segments":["解这些方程，得到驻点 ",{"tex":"(x_1^\\star,x_2^\\star)=(1/2,1/2)","text":"(x_1^\\star,x_2^\\star)=(1/2,1/2)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>⋆</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"},"，对应的拉格朗日乘子为 ",{"tex":"\\lambda=1","text":"\\lambda=1","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></math>"},"。"]},{"id":"p03-b003","page":3,"pdfPage":630,"kind":"paragraph","text":"到目前为止，讨论的都是在等式约束 $g(\\mathbf x)=0$ 下最大化函数的问题。现在考虑在不等式约束 $g(\\mathbf x)\\geqslant0$ 下最大化 $f(\\mathbf x)$，如图 C.3 所示。","segments":["到目前为止，讨论的都是在等式约束 ",{"tex":"g(\\mathbf x)=0","text":"g(\\mathbf x)=0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"}," 下最大化函数的问题。现在考虑在不等式约束 ",{"tex":"g(\\mathbf x)\\geqslant0","text":"g(\\mathbf x)\\geqslant0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⩾</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"}," 下最大化 ",{"tex":"f(\\mathbf x)","text":"f(\\mathbf x)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"},"，如图 C.3 所示。"]},{"id":"p03-b004","page":3,"pdfPage":630,"kind":"paragraph","text":"此时可能有两类解：约束下的驻点位于 $g(\\mathbf x)>0$ 的区域内，约束因而是非活跃的（inactive）；或者驻点位于边界 $g(\\mathbf x)=0$ 上，约束因而是活跃的（active）。前一种情况下，函数 $g(\\mathbf x)$ 不起作用，驻点条件只是 $\\nabla f(\\mathbf x)=0$。它仍然是拉格朗日函数 (C.4) 的驻点，不过此时 $\\lambda=0$。后一种情况下，解位于边界上，情形类似前面讨论的等式约束，对应 $\\lambda\\ne0$ 时拉格朗日函数 (C.4) 的驻点。但现在乘子的符号至关重要：只有当 $f(\\mathbf x)$ 的梯度指向远离 $g(\\mathbf x)>0$ 区域的方向时，$f(\\mathbf x)$ 才取最大值，如图 C.3 所示。因此，对某个 $\\lambda>0$，有 $\\nabla f(\\mathbf x)=-\\lambda\\nabla g(\\mathbf x)$。","segments":["此时可能有两类解：约束下的驻点位于 ",{"tex":"g(\\mathbf x)>0","text":"g(\\mathbf x)>0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"}," 的区域内，约束因而是非活跃的（inactive）；或者驻点位于边界 ",{"tex":"g(\\mathbf x)=0","text":"g(\\mathbf x)=0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"}," 上，约束因而是活跃的（active）。前一种情况下，函数 ",{"tex":"g(\\mathbf x)","text":"g(\\mathbf x)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 不起作用，驻点条件只是 ",{"tex":"\\nabla f(\\mathbf x)=0","text":"\\nabla f(\\mathbf x)=0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"},"。它仍然是拉格朗日函数 (C.4) 的驻点，不过此时 ",{"tex":"\\lambda=0","text":"\\lambda=0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"},"。后一种情况下，解位于边界上，情形类似前面讨论的等式约束，对应 ",{"tex":"\\lambda\\ne0","text":"\\lambda\\ne0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"}," 时拉格朗日函数 (C.4) 的驻点。但现在乘子的符号至关重要：只有当 ",{"tex":"f(\\mathbf x)","text":"f(\\mathbf x)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 的梯度指向远离 ",{"tex":"g(\\mathbf x)>0","text":"g(\\mathbf x)>0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"}," 区域的方向时，",{"tex":"f(\\mathbf x)","text":"f(\\mathbf x)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 才取最大值，如图 C.3 所示。因此，对某个 ",{"tex":"\\lambda>0","text":"\\lambda>0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"},"，有 ",{"tex":"\\nabla f(\\mathbf x)=-\\lambda\\nabla g(\\mathbf x)","text":"\\nabla f(\\mathbf x)=-\\lambda\\nabla g(\\mathbf x)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"},"。"]},{"id":"p03-b005","page":3,"pdfPage":630,"kind":"figure","src":"assets/appendix-c/fig-c-3.png","alt":"红色边界 g(x)=0 内为满足 g(x)>0 的区域，图示边界点 x_A 与内部点 x_B 的不等式约束极值情形","caption":"图 C.3：在不等式约束 $g(\\mathbf x)\\geqslant0$ 下最大化 $f(\\mathbf x)$ 的问题示意图。","captionSegments":["图 C.3：在不等式约束 ",{"tex":"g(\\mathbf x)\\geqslant0","text":"g(\\mathbf x)\\geqslant0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⩾</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"}," 下最大化 ",{"tex":"f(\\mathbf x)","text":"f(\\mathbf x)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 的问题示意图。"],"width":618,"height":495,"wide":true,"annotations":["图内符号：$\\mathbf x_A$ 为边界上的点","$\\mathbf x_B$ 为区域内的点","$\\nabla f(\\mathbf x)$ 和 $\\nabla g(\\mathbf x)$ 分别为目标函数与约束函数的梯度","红色边界为 $g(\\mathbf x)=0$","着色区域满足 $g(\\mathbf x)>0$。"],"annotationSegments":[["图内符号：",{"tex":"\\mathbf x_A","text":"\\mathbf x_A","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow></math>"}," 为边界上的点"],[{"tex":"\\mathbf x_B","text":"\\mathbf x_B","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow></math>"}," 为区域内的点"],[{"tex":"\\nabla f(\\mathbf x)","text":"\\nabla f(\\mathbf x)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 和 ",{"tex":"\\nabla g(\\mathbf x)","text":"\\nabla g(\\mathbf x)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 分别为目标函数与约束函数的梯度"],["红色边界为 ",{"tex":"g(\\mathbf x)=0","text":"g(\\mathbf x)=0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"}],["着色区域满足 ",{"tex":"g(\\mathbf x)>0","text":"g(\\mathbf x)>0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"},"。"]]},{"id":"p03-b006","page":3,"pdfPage":630,"kind":"paragraph","text":"对于这两类解，都有 $\\lambda g(\\mathbf x)=0$。因此，在约束 $g(\\mathbf x)\\geqslant0$ 下最大化 $f(\\mathbf x)$ 的解，可以通过对 $\\mathbf x$ 和 $\\lambda$ 优化式 (C.4) 的拉格朗日函数求得，同时满足以下条件：","segments":["对于这两类解，都有 ",{"tex":"\\lambda g(\\mathbf x)=0","text":"\\lambda g(\\mathbf x)=0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"},"。因此，在约束 ",{"tex":"g(\\mathbf x)\\geqslant0","text":"g(\\mathbf x)\\geqslant0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⩾</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"}," 下最大化 ",{"tex":"f(\\mathbf x)","text":"f(\\mathbf x)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"}," 的解，可以通过","对 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf x","text":"\\mathbf x","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow></math>"}," 和 ",{"tex":"\\lambda","text":"\\lambda","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow></math>"}," 优化式 (C.4) 的拉格朗日函数求得，同时满足以下条件："],"continuedPdfPages":[631]},{"id":"p04-b002","page":4,"pdfPage":631,"kind":"formula","tex":"g(\\mathbf x)\\geqslant0,","text":"g(\\mathbf x)\\geqslant0,","number":"(C.9)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⩾</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></math>"},{"id":"p04-b003","page":4,"pdfPage":631,"kind":"formula","tex":"\\lambda\\geqslant0,","text":"\\lambda\\geqslant0,","number":"(C.10)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>⩾</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></math>"},{"id":"p04-b004","page":4,"pdfPage":631,"kind":"formula","tex":"\\lambda g(\\mathbf x)=0.","text":"\\lambda g(\\mathbf x)=0.","number":"(C.11)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mrow></math>"},{"id":"p04-b005","page":4,"pdfPage":631,"kind":"paragraph","text":"这些条件称为 Karush–Kuhn–Tucker 条件（KKT 条件；Karush，1939；Kuhn 和 Tucker，1951）。","segments":["这些条件称为 Karush–Kuhn–Tucker 条件（KKT 条件；Karush，1939；Kuhn 和 Tucker，1951）。"]},{"id":"p04-b006","page":4,"pdfPage":631,"kind":"paragraph","text":"注意，如果要在不等式约束 $g(\\mathbf x)\\geqslant0$ 下最小化而不是最大化 $f(\\mathbf x)$，则应对 $\\mathbf x$ 最小化拉格朗日函数 $L(\\mathbf x,\\lambda)=f(\\mathbf x)-\\lambda g(\\mathbf x)$，并且仍要求 $\\lambda\\geqslant0$。","segments":["注意，如果要在不等式约束 ",{"tex":"g(\\mathbf x)\\geqslant0","text":"g(\\mathbf x)\\geqslant0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⩾</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"}," 下最小化而不是最大化 ",{"tex":"f(\\mathbf x)","text":"f(\\mathbf x)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"},"，则应对 ",{"tex":"\\mathbf x","text":"\\mathbf x","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow></math>"}," 最小化拉格朗日函数 ",{"tex":"L(\\mathbf x,\\lambda)=f(\\mathbf x)-\\lambda g(\\mathbf x)","text":"L(\\mathbf x,\\lambda)=f(\\mathbf x)-\\lambda g(\\mathbf x)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"},"，并且仍要求 ",{"tex":"\\lambda\\geqslant0","text":"\\lambda\\geqslant0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>⩾</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"},"。"]},{"id":"p04-b007","page":4,"pdfPage":631,"kind":"paragraph","text":"最后，拉格朗日乘子法很容易推广到有多个等式约束和不等式约束的情形。设在 $j=1,\\ldots,J$ 时有 $g_j(\\mathbf x)=0$，在 $k=1,\\ldots,K$ 时有 $h_k(\\mathbf x)\\geqslant0$，我们希望最大化 $f(\\mathbf x)$。引入乘子 $\\{\\lambda_j\\}$ 和 $\\{\\mu_k\\}$，然后优化拉格朗日函数","segments":["最后，拉格朗日乘子法很容易推广到有多个等式约束和不等式约束的情形。设在 ",{"tex":"j=1,\\ldots,J","text":"j=1,\\ldots,J","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>J</mi></mrow></math>"}," 时有 ",{"tex":"g_j(\\mathbf x)=0","text":"g_j(\\mathbf x)=0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"},"，在 ",{"tex":"k=1,\\ldots,K","text":"k=1,\\ldots,K","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow></math>"}," 时有 ",{"tex":"h_k(\\mathbf x)\\geqslant0","text":"h_k(\\mathbf x)\\geqslant0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⩾</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"},"，我们希望最大化 ",{"tex":"f(\\mathbf x)","text":"f(\\mathbf x)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></math>"},"。引入乘子 ",{"tex":"\\{\\lambda_j\\}","text":"\\{\\lambda_j\\}","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></math>"}," 和 ",{"tex":"\\{\\mu_k\\}","text":"\\{\\mu_k\\}","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></math>"},"，然后优化拉格朗日函数"]},{"id":"p04-b008","page":4,"pdfPage":631,"kind":"formula","tex":"L(\\mathbf x,\\{\\lambda_j\\},\\{\\mu_k\\})\n=f(\\mathbf x)+\\sum_{j=1}^{J}\\lambda_j g_j(\\mathbf x)\n+\\sum_{k=1}^{K}\\mu_k h_k(\\mathbf x),","text":"L(\\mathbf x,\\{\\lambda_j\\},\\{\\mu_k\\})\n=f(\\mathbf x)+\\sum_{j=1}^{J}\\lambda_j g_j(\\mathbf x)\n+\\sum_{k=1}^{K}\\mu_k h_k(\\mathbf x),","number":"(C.12)","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>J</mi></munderover><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></math>"},{"id":"p04-b009","page":4,"pdfPage":631,"kind":"paragraph","text":"并对 $k=1,\\ldots,K$ 满足 $\\mu_k\\geqslant0$ 和 $\\mu_k h_k(\\mathbf x)=0$。受约束的泛函导数也可作类似推广（见附录 B）。关于拉格朗日乘子法的更详细讨论，见 Nocedal 和 Wright（1999）。","segments":["并对 ",{"tex":"k=1,\\ldots,K","text":"k=1,\\ldots,K","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow></math>"}," 满足 ",{"tex":"\\mu_k\\geqslant0","text":"\\mu_k\\geqslant0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>⩾</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"}," 和 ",{"tex":"\\mu_k h_k(\\mathbf x)=0","text":"\\mu_k h_k(\\mathbf x)=0","mathml":"<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>"},"。受约束的泛函导数也可作类似推广（见附录 B）。关于拉格朗日乘子法的更详细讨论，见 Nocedal 和 Wright（1999）。"]}]}